## Ghosting: back corners
Ghosting, back corners, three minutes. Medium pace. Go via the corner of the service box, swing on
the beep, and get back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium back]
28% Rest. Plant at forty-five degrees. Full swish.
-0:03 [countdown]
36% @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium back]
63% Rest. Fast back to the T. Split step.
-0:03 [countdown]
72% @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium back]
